            "block_content": "Employees eligible for the Package are active Boeing salaried employees represented by the Society of Professional Engineering Employees in Aerospace ('SPEEA). The employee is not eligible to entroll if he or she is working in a capacity that, at the sole discretion of the plan administrator, is considered contract labor or independent contracting.",
