        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Dependents eligible for the medical and dental plans are the employee's legal spouse and children (natural children, adopted children, children legally placed with the employee for adoption, and stepchildren) who are under age 25, unmarried, and dependent on the employee for principal support, including children who are attending school.",
